Step 2b: snake arrows, symmetric boards, zoom and pan, lives, hints, themes

Arrows are now bent snakes that slide out along their own path. Levels are
symmetrical patterns on a growing dot grid, generated so they are always
solvable. The board is an SVG with wheel, pinch and drag zoom and pan.
Adds 3 lives per game (a blocked tap costs one), 2 free hints per level
then a score cost, pause, fullscreen, and light and dark themes.

